        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Picture of woven silk and gold thread, framed; the main parts of the design are indicated in the woven fabric, the other details having been subsequently painted with the brush. This scene shows a rocky landscape with pavilions and water. In the foreground is a procession of boys parading a model dragon; other boys carry lamps, banners, and instruments. There are boys in the foreground and background lighting fireworks."@en , "Brocade picture, mounted in frame, series of 4, China, mid-18th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a9ac6f6c-b624-3451-b641-0b9b1b10ee3e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/bcc2f9e3-1a3d-332c-b0cc-3a8e8deb8515> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Brocade picture, mounted in frame, series of 4, China, mid-18th century"@en , "Picture of woven silk and gold thread, framed; the main parts of the design are indicated in the woven fabric, the other details having been subsequently painted with the brush. This scene shows a rocky landscape with pavilions and water. In the foreground is a procession of boys parading a model dragon; other boys carry lamps, banners, and instruments. There are boys in the foreground and background lighting fireworks."@en ;
